<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Daimler Deutsche Telekom traffic deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears Daimler Deutsche Telekom traffic deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday  it had cleared Daimler and Deutsche Telekom to pursue a venture in  the area of traffic systems.</p>
<p>There were no details immediately available.</p>
<p>--BRUSSELS NEWSROOM: +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
